    "name": {
      "value": "Wand of Noisome Acid (8th-level Spell)"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This greasy stick emits a stomach-churning scent when held in hand.\n\nFrequency: once per day\nYou cast acid arrow of the indicated level. A creature that takes initial acid damage from this spell become sickened 1. Use your spell DC if the creature attempts to recover from this sickness. This is an olfactory effect.\n\n**Craft Requirements:** Supply a casting of acid arrow of the appropriate level."
